      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Solo tienes que esquivar los ataques de Pokémon\nsalvajes sin salirte de la zona designada.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eso sí! No vale usar tus Pokémon para combatir\nni lanzar Poké Balls.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450073006F0020007300ED00210020004E006F002000760061006C006500200075007300610072002000740075007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020007000610072006100200063006F006D00620061007400690072000A006E00690020006C0061006E007A0061007200200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C0073002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aquí estarás sol<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa ante el peligro y todo depende\nde ti. ¡Lo llamo \"<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Esquiva como puedas<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\"!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nVen a hablar conmigo si te atreves.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres participar en \"Esquiva como puedas\",\nla experiencia extrema donde deberás esquivar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nataques sin usar Pokémon ni Poké Balls?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Acepto el reto!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410063006500700074006F00200065006C0020007200650074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora no",
